bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/k15-custody-step-zero.mem:43:This table covers every `buildTable()` row in `packages/lararium-node/src/vault-carriers.ts:236-398`. “Current” names the code's custody class. “Owner / target” is the K15 contract. Where the source only names a filename, ''LEAD'' requires a payload and caller audit before the classification can be implemented. There is no implicit S catchall.
